    + `<div class="lb"><span>Arah ikan — simpan 🐟 dalam bingkai</span><span>${G.mudah ? "joran ikut sendiri" : "◀ ▶"}</span></div><div class="trk"><i class="rz" data-p8r="1" style="left:${50 + G.rx * 45}%"></i><i class="fz" data-p8f="1" style="left:${50 + G.fx * 45}%">🐟</i></div>`
