/* ---------- §136. Matlamat mingguan — three weekly goals from a pool of twelve, in 🎯 Matlamat under "🗓️ Mingguan" (hf127, rk-sims
   22 Nov; owner: "Tambah matlamat mingguan"). Beside 📋 Misi hari ini (daily, section 19), 🌤️ Hari Pertama (§126) and 🎯 Matlamat
   keluarga minggu ini (§127, three fixed goals): this one draws 3 goals each game week (week = Math.floor(dayIdx() / 7), Isnin to
   Ahad, as the game's own day counter) from twelve, seeded by the week and the house, so a reload shows the same three.
   Every goal counts only what the game already reports (no counter of its own that nothing fires):
    - emit(s2, ev, data) of a family member at home: "a" cook/goreng, water, pray, sleep (energy ≥ 70, one a day); "yard" laundry;
      "errand" (the place trips: congkak, galah, wau, selling at the kedai / bazar / pasar malam / dusun, solat, sembahyang, puja,
      misa, kenduri, rewang, rumah terbuka); "s"/"f" (a chat); "party" (a majlis, once); "buy" (furniture placed, once a minute);
    - endVisit (a visit ended, home again: as §127);
    - the rounds the painted mini-games keep, read as they grow (gasing, sepak raga, congkak, batu seremban, galah panjang, wau,
      Angkat kain, Gerai Depan Rumah: S.hfGasing.n … S.hfHarian.bisnes.n), only at home (they are per house);
    - 🧳 Tabung percutian (§72): what the jar holds above the week's start.
   Each goal done: toast, +RM 40, +25 mata hidup (as section 19's missions, a little more). All three: +RM 100, +50 mata hidup and
   everyone at home who feels nothing worse "gembira" 3 hours. A new week: three new goals (the inbox says so when last week had some).
   Religion: "Ibadat" counts the solat, sembahyang, puja and misa the game already has for each faith, worded for all (semak dengan
   rk-budaya).
   One weekly panel (owner, same day): §127's household goals are listed in it under "🏠 Matlamat keluarga" (§127 still counts and
   rewards them, data S.hfFamilyWeeks unchanged); §127 no longer draws a list of its own.
   Save: S.hfMingguan = {[home]: {w, L: [{id, n, ok}], all, seen: {counter: n}, tab, sd}} (optional; an old save makes this week's on
   first look; bad values heal). It is part of S, so slots and backups keep it. Tests: RKHF.mingguan, tools/qa/scenes/mingguan.mjs. */
